{"ID":"20240205164744-m8irv4r","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164744-m8irv4r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164744-m8irv4r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103405-fpm8ryn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607125334-1lmac1x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619152218-0sg70n4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"071五味子","type":"doc","updated":"20240807161603"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240807154141-27ire14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807154141-27ire14","updated":"20240807154144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北五味子"}]},{"ID":"20240206103405-fpm8ryn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103405-fpm8ryn","updated":"20240206103414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产东北地区。\n【性状】\t干燥果实略呈球形或扁球形，直径58mm。外皮鲜红色，紫红色或暗红色。显油润，有不整齐的皱缩。果肉柔软，常数个粘连一起；内含种子12枚，肾形，棕黄色，有光泽，坚硬，种仁白色。果肉气微弱而特殊，味酸。种子破碎后有香气，味辛而苦。\n【性味】\t酸、甘，温。\n【功效】\t收敛固涩，益气生津，补肾宁心。用于久嗽虚喘，梦遗滑精，遗尿尿频，久泻不止，自汗，盗汗，津伤口渴，短气脉虚，内热消渴，心悸失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103407-nzt8pbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103407-nzt8pbh","updated":"20240206103407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103407-bwjgwbi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165409-sc6p8os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165409-sc6p8os","updated":"20240619150250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Ty